<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 Part 1, Section 4.2. The class is what a process needs to say who does the work: an operator states what happens, a resource states what performs it, and the assignment ties the two."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Energy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Information> .
