<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#isWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 Part 1, Section 4.1 introduces the system limit as the observation horizon but does not name a relation locating elements inside it. This relation is an addition of this pattern, required to determine which elements lie within a given system limit and whether that limit may serve as a balance limit."@en .
